      "atMain": true,
      "command": "timeout 180 node scripts/audit-a11y-dev-view.mjs --base-url http://127.0.0.1:3217 --artifact artifacts/a11y/axe-dev-view.json --strict",
      "exitCode": 124,
      "status": "blocked",
      "reason": "The strict axe lane never completes at main. Surfaces 1 and 2 load, but surface 3 (Dev View at 320 px) waits in a page.evaluate until every document animation has stopped, and the fixture's Running worktree row (feature/example) renders a lucide-loader-circle spinner (animate-spin, 1 s, infinite) that never stops. The lane was killed by timeout (exit 124) after 180 s; two earlier attempts (one under bun, one under node) ran for more than 13 and about 8 minutes with the same stall. No artifact was written and no surface counts as scanned. The lane and the fixture were not changed in this record. The 2026-10-10 run completed on a tree that differs from main in 29 app and package files; which change introduced the never-ending animation is not identified here. Browser: Chromium 141.0.7390.37 (the container's 1194 build), not the Playwright build the repository pins."
    },
